# Doran Empire

id:polity-doran-empire a oa:Polity ;
    skos:prefLabel "Doran Empire" ;
    oa:ambiguousName false ;
    oa:color "#A1887F" ;
    oa:dissolvedAT 5855 ;
    oa:editorialNote "Cyber-tweak clade out of Solsys in 629, first colony at Gliese 877 in 929,\nthen the red and orange dwarfs of the Inner Sphere. Fragmented over the\nConsolidation wars; its last remnants entered the Terragen Federation in\n5855. Read from the Sesharia and Dorangloon articles." ;
    oa:hasSource src:eg-system-articles ;
    oa:kind "meta-empire" ;
    oa:polityId "doran-empire" ;
    oa:recordOrder 49 ;
    oa:uncertain false .
